## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to bridge Go and C safely in a streaming, callback-driven API, including memory ownership, callbacks from C into Go, and lifecycle handling.

## Key Concepts
- CGO and cgo.Handle usage
- Cross-language callbacks and goroutine scheduling
- Memory ownership and finalizers
- Error handling across language boundaries

